{"title":"3 Hrs Saturday Morning Feather Birdies Badminton","startsAt":"2026-10-03T09:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-03T12:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**Event Cost :** **$15** per person. (cash only) More then one brand new **Feather Birdies** per person to be supplied by event host.\n**Racquets :** Bring your own racquet. Rentals are available at the club if needed.\n**Shoes :** Please bring indoor gym shoes and change into them at the club before entering the courts.\n**Attention !!! please let us know at least 48 hours (Thursday@3PM) in advance if you or your guest can’t make it. This gives those on the waitlist a chance to join! Please note that \"no-shows\" or late cancellations are tracked; even a single occurrence may result in removal from the group to ensure active participation. Thanks for your cooperation!**","venue":{"name":"Tiger badminton","address":"7755 warden ave, Unit 7, Markham","lat":43.83723,"lng":-79.32842,"city":"Markham"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto-GTA Badminton Meetup","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/4/e/4/highres_535145348.jpeg"}